# Code Organization

## App

- `app/` — setup, routing, theme, auth layout, exports
- `layouts/` — home layout, tabs
- `presentation/` — pages, feature widgets, dialogs
- `utils/` — app-only helpers (e.g. product tour)

## Packages

- `core/.../application` — blocs
- `core/.../services`, `repositories`, `controllers`, `wrappers` — interfaces + implementations
- `models/lib/src` — DTOs, DB models, enums, mappers
- `ui_kit/lib/src` — widgets and constants
- `theme/lib/src` — colors and extensions

Follow the folder nearest the change before creating a new one. Keep files focused; use trailing commas.
